      <div class="eeat-item">
        <div class="eeat-icon">🏛️</div>
        <h4>NIST & WHO Benchmark Alignment</h4>
        <p>Unit conversions are mathematically cross-verified against NIST Special Publication 811, and BMI scores conform directly to WHO technical reports.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="eeat-item">
        <div class="eeat-icon">🎓</div>
        <h4>Peer-Reviewed Editorial Review</h4>
        <p>Mathematical formulas, order of operations, and financial algorithms are continuously maintained and validated by computational specialists.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
